{
  "uid": "ai-agents-efficiency",
  "title": "AI agents (消費と生産の比)",
  "description": "Managed by chezmoi from kosako/dotfiles (otel-backend module, #541). Tokens spent per unit produced: per edit, commit, prompt and Codex run, with consumption and output overlaid (events in Loki). Edit the JSON in dotfiles, not in the UI.",
